[00:12.58]1. Because Jehovah created
[00:19.70]The universe so grand,
[00:25.12]To him belong the earth and sky,
[00:32.90]The works of his own hand.
[00:38.90]The breath of life he has given
[00:45.00]And to his creatures shown
[00:51.56]That worthy is he to have the praise,
[00:58.20]The worship of all his own.
[01:13.70]2. In water Jesus was baptized
[01:20.30]To righteousness fulfill.
[01:26.68]In solemn prayer he said to God:
[01:32.68]‘I’ve come to do your will.’
[01:38.78]When he came up from the Jordan
[01:45.18]As God’s anointed Son,
[01:52.62]Obedient and loyal he would pray:
[01:58.40]‘My Father, your will be done.’
[02:18.28]3. We come before you, Jehovah,
[02:24.96]To praise your name so great.
[02:31.68]Disowning self, with humble hearts,
[02:37.58]Our lives we dedicate.
[02:43.30]You gave your only begotten,
[02:50.94]Who paid the price so high.
[02:57.06]No longer as living for ourselves,
[03:03.50]For you we will live or die.
